      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Morale needs boosting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;After Adora's great victory against the Imperial Horde, the rebels seek a moment of calm amidst the chaos. in that, Adora is tasked with sewing some chaos.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Meanwhile, our Valiant space captain wrestles with her demons as nefarious agendas advance around her.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>Jezmatron</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
